    "description": "Shop online with Eaze and get cannabis delivered to your door the same day, in 100+ cities across California and Michigan.\r\n\r\nGet $20 off your first delivery with code: \u201cEAZE20\u201d.\r\n\r\nON-DEMAND DELIVERY\r\n\r\nGet your weed delivered on demand.\r\n\r\nREAL-TIME ORDER TRACKING\r\n\r\nTrack your weed as it heads your way.\r\n\r\nSee the estimated delivery time to your address.\r\n\r\nGet notified when your order arrives.\r\n\r\nDISCOVER AMAZING DEALS\r\n\r\nShop our selection of rotating deals for the biggest blaze for your buck.\r\n\r\nDANK SELECTION\r\n\r\nShop our wide menu of products across a variety of categories:\r\n\r\nFlowers, Prerolls, Edibles, Concentrates, Wellness, Tinctures, Capsules, Accessories\r\n\r\nShop our highly curated selection of the best brands, for the best value:\r\n\r\nKiva Confections, PLUS, LEUNE, STIIIZY, Humboldt Farms, dosist, Kanha, WYLD, Island, Jetty, Foxy, Pacific Stone, Old Pal, PAX, Emerald Sky, Heavy Hitters, Circles, Everyday, Pure Beauty, dompen, Cann, Bloom Farms, LAKEGRADE, Select, Ember Valley, Smokiez, Legion of Bloom, Dreamt, Mary's Medicinals, Punch Edibles, Herbology, Flow Kana, Happy Sticks, Kurvana, Tutti, El Blunto, Kingston Royal, Elite California, SF Roots\r\n\r\nEASY PAYMENT\r\n\r\nPay with your debit card, bank account, or cash.\r\n\r\nCANNABIS FOR A CAUSE\r\n\r\nWe always stock women-and BIPOC-owned brands, so you can spend on what matters.\r\n\r\nYou can also shop minority-owned products from social equity brands that have graduated our *Momentum Cannabis Business Accelerator Program* as well as the brand sponsors that make the program possible:\r\n\r\nLeune, Cann, Everyday, Cloud, Country, Garden Society, Vertosa\r\n\r\nLEARN ABOUT CANNABIS\r\n\r\nLearn about marijuana, find inspiration in our gift guides, and learn more about the cannabis brands that we carry through our blog:\r\n\r\nEaze Insights | State of Cannabis 2022, Women\u2019s History Month Spotlights, Mother\u2019s Day 2022 Gift Guide, Black-Owned Brands to Look Out for on Eaze, Your Cannabis Guide to Cuffing Season, Environmental Advocacy Through Cannabis, Best-Selling Cannabis Products of 2021.",
